      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到港口。",
        "You arrive at The Harbor."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5f959e90-5ef2-4568-a722-3516db9bc313",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到琼的修理铺。",
        "You arrive at June’s Workshop."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "e40a2985-f46d-4f97-a551-7b137c99b345",
      "kind": "talk",
      "person": "june",
      "text": [
        "穿工装的女人从工作台旁抬起头：“我是琼，这间修理铺是我的。全年都有人弄坏东西。需要借工具？”",
        "The woman at the workbench looks up. “June. Like the sign. Things break all year, though. Need to borrow something?”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "5d26d89c-3840-464c-830d-ae2fb3e8d7f7",
      "kind": "talk",
      "person": "june",
      "text": [
        "她递来一只工具箱：“记得带回来。镇上的小修小补都用得上。你先看看要修的东西，别急着拆。”",
        "She hands you a toolkit. “Bring it back sometime. Good for little repairs around town. Have a look at what is broken before taking anything apart.”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f7640513-bbc9-4aa4-acf5-7bccfa9f1b41",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到港口。",
