      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "222aeeff-0430-4c57-808f-f4d403f9b870",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到滨海道。",
        "You arrive at Coastal Path."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "9be029b9-f2ef-44ca-aef5-c68397f25999",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "新桥板固定好了。你试着踩上去，木头稳稳承住你的重量。",
        "The new boards hold. You test your weight on them; the bridge stays steady."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2d017f70-d6aa-4112-b0db-cdc38b4fb09c",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到海岸。",
        "You arrive at The Coast."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "6b57d26c-f513-4335-bcc8-40c1a1d2c04e",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "你来到灯塔。",
        "You arrive at The Lighthouse."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ec2e9645-d296-436e-b112-54e7f873da6f",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
        "桥边的封闭牌摘下了。新路既方便，也保住了住户的安静。",
        "The closure sign comes down by the bridge. Access is restored, and the residents keep their quiet."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "673b7369-d587-45f6-b088-027cdcdb1124",
      "kind": "action",
      "text": [
